  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of The Challenge Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to MSI-US will support The Challenge Fund, a multi-donor effort to increase support for sexual and reproductive health and rights in West Africa. Our funding will complement funding from CIFF and FCDO focused on Mali and Burkina Faso where MSI will implement a large, multi-year program of work including public sector strengthening of contraceptive services, community mobilization, and advocacy for improved policies. This grant, while aligned with the Global Reproductive Equity strategy, is being made as a special project of the GEG program with one-time funds.</narrative>
  </description>
